<title>POLAND: Polish construction falls 0.9 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Polish construction falls 0.9 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's July construction sales fell 0.9 percent from June's 11.1-percent rise and 11.3-percent higher from a year ago, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>Construction sales rose 23.2 percent in the January-July</p>
<p>period against the same 1996 period.</p>
<p> POLISH CONSTRUCTION		JULY	 JUNE	  JULY 96</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	   -0.9   11.1(10.8)	 6.7</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		   11.3   20.6(20.2)	15.4</p>
<p> index (mthly avge 1994=100)	52.7	  53.7	 36.4</p>
<p>					    JAN-JULY  97    JAN-JULY 96</p>
<p> pct change vs same period		 23.2		0.1</p>
<p>NOTES - Revised data in brackets. July 1997 had 23 working days, June 1997 had 22 working days and July 1996 had 24 days.</p>
